{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手黃妍、Michael C日前出席「長者港鐵安全運動」，與數十位「老友記」在香港站港鐵藝術舞台見面，透過音樂向「老友記」宣傳鐵路安全信息和分享乘搭港鐵時有禮行為。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:38:14.237721+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:08:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T17:58:12.626392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:38:14.237721+00:00","content_hash":"dd4f0152cc85c8d4942be94fae0440cb8e04f9889a941ec7097d8fb64857c318","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}